<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-HANOVER GRAND PRIX QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HANOVER GRAND PRIX QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter final results at</p>
<p>$450,000 Hanover Grand Prix women's tennis tournament on Friday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) beat Sandrine Testud (France) 6-1</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>1-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat 8-Yelena Likhovtseva</p>
<p>(Russia) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>6-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Miriam Overmans (Netherlands)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>3-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) 4-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-4</p>
</text>
